{
  "answer": "To create a WebSocket endpoint in FastAPI, use the `ws` module and define a WebSocket endpoint with the `ws` decorator. \n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, WebSocket\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n@app.websocket(\"/ws\")\nasync def websocket_endpoint(websocket: WebSocket):\n    await websocket.accept()\n    # Handle WebSocket messages and events here\n    await websocket.send(\"Hello from the server!\")\n```\n\nThis will create a WebSocket endpoint at the `/ws` path.",
